      ":question/problem": "Let $P$ be a $11\\times 9$ matrix that has $7$ **pivot** columns. What is the rank of the matrix?",
      ":question/worked-solution": "We know that $\\text{rank}(P)$ is the number of pivot columns in $P.$ \n\nSince we are told that $P$ has $7$ pivot columns, we have \n\n$$\n\\text{rank}(P)=7.\n$$",
